+            + "you to specify an endpoint override when the client is created.\");\n"
+            + "      }";
+        String constructorWarning =
+            "if (clientConfiguration.option(SdkClientOption.CLIENT_ENDPOINT_PROVIDER).isEndpointOverridden()) {\n"
